    "value": [
      {
        "id": "R1",
        "text": "Moves are orthogonal; only X is blocked, and S is never re-entered."
      },
      {
        "id": "R2",
        "text": "Leaving a cell with digit d adds times[d-1] and costs[d-1]; leaving S adds nothing; switching modes is free."
      },
      {
        "id": "R3",
        "text": "Minimise the pair (total time, total cost) lexicographically."
      },
      {
        "id": "R4",
        "text": "Return [time, cost] for D, or [-1, -1] when D is unreachable."
      },
      {
        "id": "R5",
        "text": "Inputs are unchanged; a fresh list is returned."
      }
