    "status": "present",
    "value": "Use the same city grid and the same charging rule as variant 1 (leaving a mode cell costs that mode's time and cost, leaving S is free, X is blocked), but now a route may pass through cells of any modes, switching freely with no extra charge. Find the route to D whose total (time, cost) pair is smallest, comparing time first and cost second, and return [time, cost]. Return [-1, -1] if D cannot be reached."
  },
